<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Kot Kapura | Covered &amp; Open Car Carriers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero scratches during Car Transportation In Kot Kapura?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our zero‑scratch guarantee stems from a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging system combined with hydraulic ramp loading that eliminates manual handling. Each vehicle is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings, wheel chocks, and custom wooden crates for fragile parts. Real‑time GPS monitoring and post‑delivery inspections confirm the vehicle’s pristine condition, and any damage is covered by our IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for a car shipped from Kot Kapura to major hubs like Delhi or Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Transit time varies with distance and highway traffic, but our optimized route via National Highway corridors averages 12‑14 hours to Delhi and 28‑30 hours to Mumbai. We factor in toll stops, driver shifts, and real‑time traffic updates to provide accurate ETAs, and customers receive live GPS updates throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are the hydraulic ramp carriers in Kot Kapura fully sanitized for contactless loading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All hydraulic ramp carriers undergo a thorough sanitization protocol before each loading. Surfaces are disinfected with hospital‑grade cleaners, and the ramp mechanism is wiped down to meet zero‑contact standards. Drivers also wear gloves and masks, ensuring a hygienic environment for both the vehicle and the owner.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it’s on the road from Kot Kapura?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every Shree Ashirwad carrier is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link via SMS and email, allowing you to monitor the exact position, speed, and estimated arrival time of your car throughout the transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included with the car carrier service in Kot Kapura?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All shipments are covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. This policy protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities during the entire journey. In the unlikely event of a claim, we handle documentation and settlement swiftly, ensuring peace of mind for the vehicle owner.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How do I prepare my car and documents for RTO clearance before the move from Kot Kapura?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Prepare a clean copy of the Registration Certificate, valid insurance, Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate, and a signed consent form. Remove personal belongings, disable alarms, and ensure the fuel tank is below ¼ full. Our logistics team can assist with on‑site verification and guide you through any additional RTO requirements.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
